# Large generated artifacts of the evaluation layer.
#
# Never committed:
#   data/cache/            cached light curves (ml)
#   data/corpus/           corpus PDFs + extracted page text (licensing: local only)
#   data/ml_benchmark.jsonl  generated injection benchmark
#   results/               raw run outputs, logs
#
# Deliberately tracked:
#   data/benchmark_manifest.json  frozen benchmark provenance
#   data/corpus_manifest.json     frozen corpus provenance and licences
#   data/rag_queries.jsonl        queries + relevance judgments (no source text)
#   reports/, tests/, scripts
data/cache/
data/corpus/
data/ml_benchmark.jsonl
results/

# Track 2 enriched dataset: derived from live Gaia/MAST queries, not reproducible
# offline, and irrelevant to the committed study. Regenerate with
#   python evaluation/track2/build_enriched_targets.py --per-class 8
# (curve cache is kept locally so reruns do not re-download).
track2/enriched/cache/
track2/enriched/labels.json
track2/enriched/labels_*.json
track2/enriched/*.tmp.json
